# What never needs to reach a build.
#
# The context was 506 MB, 396 of it the client's videos and PDFs in `docs/`
# (audit A11, M9). Every byte of that is sent to the daemon on every build,
# and on a CI runner that is the build.

.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.nx
.next
**/.next
out
**/out
**/.env
**/.env.local
*.log
.playwright-mcp
.agents
apps/api/src/generated

# The decision log and the reference design: 420 MB between them, and neither
# is compiled into anything.
docs
screenshots
apps/frontend/origin

# Tooling that belongs to whoever is working on this, not to the image.
.vercel
.claude
.codex
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store

# Documentation. The three standards files and AGENTS.md are the ones a build
# would notice missing, and it would not: nothing reads them at build time.
*.md
